==Battleground==
*2 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*2 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*2 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ginger Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**6 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**4 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Anti-Red fodder is easily able to clear this stage.

